# Issue #2864 (DWPB-1, greenfield flag day): unlinks refused for a stale
# rotation baseline now return the `document_unlink_rotation_baseline_stale`
# code, a new member of DocumentMutationErrorCode shared by every document and
# container mutation 409. Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as main
# contains the new contract.
